# Which folders renv reads when it works out which R packages this project
# needs (same pattern syntax as .gitignore). The R code is in planarsviz/,
# laminar/ (the renderer) and NonCollaborative/ (the porting checks and the
# archived scripts they run), plus two files at the root; everything else in
# the repository is Python, data or documents, and scanning it only slows
# renv down. NonCollaborative/.renvignore leaves out the hand-written scripts
# there that nothing runs.

/*
!/planarsviz/
!/laminar/
!/NonCollaborative/
!/_dependencies.R
!/lint_and_style_planarsviz.R

# Generated output and reference material, no R code.
/NonCollaborative/results/
/NonCollaborative/readings/
/NonCollaborative/domains/
/NonCollaborative/planar_tables/
